# DUB
.dub
docs.json
__dummy.html
# V8 i18n profile ships icudtl.dat next to the binary (auto-copied
# by dub's postBuildCommands). The file lives in vendor/v8/lib/ and
# build/ — both are out of source. The root-level icudtl.dat is a
# build artifact (from running dun-rel-v8 in cwd).
/icudtl.dat
build/icudtl.dat
# (`docs/` is intentionally tracked — user-facing documentation.
# dub's `--build=docs` would generate ddoc output here; we don't
# use that target so the directory is reserved for hand-written docs.)

